# PART I — PROJECT IDENTITY AND PURPOSE

## 1. Application Name

**AquaTrack**

Official tagline:

**“Track Every Drop. Protect Every Tomorrow.”**

Use the exact spelling and capitalization of AquaTrack throughout the application, logo, page titles, metadata, documentation, navigation, and branding.

## 2. Application Purpose

AquaTrack is a comprehensive water conservation and environmental education platform that helps users understand their water consumption, record daily activities, identify wasteful habits, set achievable conservation goals, monitor progress, receive personalized recommendations, learn about environmental responsibility, explore Philippine environmental laws, and participate in interactive educational games.

The platform should transform water conservation into an engaging daily habit by combining practical tracking tools, informative analytics, personalized learning, gamification, an AI-powered assistant, reminders, and offline accessibility.

The website should communicate that every individual can contribute to responsible water use and environmental protection.

